@@section 1
@@title CQ-TTP Tall tooltips, Curios slot line, PneumaticCraft text, 2026-11-02 ([tooltips.md](../tooltips.md) 3 and 7; TODO `ui/tooltips #5`, `#8`, `#9`)
@@date 2026-11-02
@@sources feature_writeup/tooltips.md
@@text
@@text Needs Creative Common 1.1.07 built 2026-11-02 00:06 or later (installed) and a full restart (the PneumaticCraft listener is a
@@text startup script). Client only; no server half (all three are client tooltip code).
